body:
Review fixes completed on `c0e2e94bc4aa68ffd7cd63d322efa060f3d2e20e`:

- scheduling composite FKs now use cascade actions compatible with tenant deletion;
- `scheduled_for_utc` is explicitly stored/read as UTC, independent of `APP_TIMEZONE`;
- added non-UTC application-timezone regression coverage;
- added failed, queued and stale-processor eligibility regressions;
- added migration-missing GET/POST safety coverage.

GrindFlow CI #255: preflight ✅, fast ✅, php-quality ✅, PHPUnit ✅, MariaDB ✅, browser ✅, validate ✅; legacy intentionally skipped by scope.
